{
  "mabel|Cards are on the table, everyone play nice.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-c9575e07625117e64941.webm",
  "mabel|New game, fresh luck, and maybe a win in my future.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-65a12806ee0c11ab6f70.webm",
  "mabel|All right, friends, let's make this a good one.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-bf0f32ae22394aa30124.webm",
  "mabel|Settle in, let's play.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-3695688ff41627ce454a.webm",
  "mabel|Here we are again, good cards, great company.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-99b217a4731e5c277650.webm",
  "mabel|New round, new mischief.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-18b8d634a4359e841570.webm",
  "mabel|Let's see what this deal has in store.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-5ddf94e30fc62d597ed9.webm",
  "mabel|Round's live; Let's get started.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-7a55ff7ced421995c532.webm",
  "mabel|All right, let's see these cards.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-319329fed65d9f70124b.webm",
  "mabel|Maybe this deal will be kind to me.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-20147e44b23d7419a508.webm",
  "mabel|My crib.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-bc5a5b4c149dd3532803.webm",
  "mabel|My crib, send me good cards.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-57aef84cc59f7e43ab25.webm",
  "mabel|Looks like I get the crib.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-fe26c6059c381a331679.webm",
  "mabel|That's fifteen for two, thank you very much.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-356c28139f1c38ece3e5.webm",
  "mabel|A tidy little fifteen for two.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-8f6472b88f2d756fd706.webm",
  "mabel|I'll take fifteen for two.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-59689772883674b4f381.webm",
  "mabel|That worked out rather nicely.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-8f75958a9c1abbc5bdf7.webm",
  "mabel|Nice fifteen there.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-b2908eea17a88c86d776.webm",
  "mabel|Well played.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-32d594501f1e8d711adf.webm",
  "mabel|Good one.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-8d7de976fc4df78af690.webm",
  "mabel|Fifteen for two, way to go.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-25f1a21d936af2f02a87.webm",
  "mabel|That's a handy two points.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-89ddeede2f88d7d9f3b8.webm",
  "mabel|Thirty-one, love it.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-2e84d7e894947d351f8d.webm",
  "mabel|Thirty-one, go me!": "table-talk-voice/mabel-d697cd1c8d35f39aad4c.webm",
  "mabel|Thirty-one exactly; thank you kindly.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-64d892018bc53cf4e974.webm",
  "mabel|Right on! Thirty-one.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-61ca720d8d4058806aa6.webm",
  "mabel|Thirty-one on the nose, nice work.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-61d3ac9a20e56c0c719c.webm",
  "mabel|Perfect thirty-one.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-ffb4672c54213a5a0727.webm",
  "mabel|Sharp play.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-1b1d66c108a04f51ff72.webm",
  "mabel|Nice, thirty-one.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-ae49dbf1a99987b06b48.webm",
  "mabel|You timed that one well.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-87888a86f2de89922cd4.webm",
  "mabel|A quick pair keeps me smiling.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-05f8898f6eebce80753e.webm",
  "mabel|Pair for me; little victories count.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-9276b81f167d3e9864f3.webm",
  "mabel|I'll take those two points, thanks.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-23b4c378aec734ae4a8e.webm",
  "mabel|A pair will do me just fine.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-bf33e51eb237a5173647.webm",
  "mabel|Two points for me.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-22b192423a7a60269abd.webm",
  "mabel|I'll take the pair for two points.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-492c7bfda7f469194bc7.webm",
  "mabel|Pair well played.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-37519d92b2e6ca52d660.webm",
  "mabel|Such a hansome pair.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-e82bf1b860cb4238d2bd.webm",
  "mabel|Two points!": "table-talk-voice/mabel-1dc5785d892e67c89855.webm",
  "mabel|Pair royal! That'll wake the pegs up.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-99fa47bb51a71ef8b70e.webm",
  "mabel|Six points and a happy grin from me.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-04725a6b6d1a205ca2b6.webm",
  "mabel|Pair royal does brighten a hand.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-253aa4d3a8fd05de8fac.webm",
  "mabel|Six points is an instant feel good.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-6ab7d93e45ee9f537eb6.webm",
  "mabel|I love it when a pair royal lines up.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-9c006a09ca7ea9cdc6ba.webm",
  "mabel|Pair royal, very nice.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-39a0304bab15b2111ca2.webm",
  "mabel|Six points. Lucky or clever?": "table-talk-voice/mabel-7512523c3cf91285aec9.webm",
  "mabel|Now that's a lively pair royal.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-7cbc4011e24af2045453.webm",
  "mabel|Six points for you.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-ade2d02e259b8bea14da.webm",
  "mabel|A pair royal is always a welcome surprise.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-071029c37925b091d880.webm",
  "mabel|Double pair royal! I won't pretend to be humble.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-e01c240ec2a0f4677729.webm",
  "mabel|Well now, twelve points does sparkle.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-f5bf1bec03e399badaa7.webm",
  "mabel|That is a very welcome twelve.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-c2dc252b4716cc691d76.webm",
  "mabel|Well, those pegs can stretch their legs.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-c80f7d847ce11fe7aa57.webm",
  "mabel|Double pair royal, goodness me.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-cde25e14cef62322e276.webm",
  "mabel|Twelve points? Nicely done.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-e8105dbdb54a769188dc.webm",
  "mabel|That's a beautiful twelve-point burst. Well done.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-caadd6afc364a3442d74.webm",
  "mabel|Very rare, way to go.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-a1d6b6d1ef543dc4d761.webm",
  "mabel|A very tidy twelve points.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-45d50e73e0d491563a0f.webm",
  "mabel|That run marched in nicely.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-9ea9830bc8398802275f.webm",
  "mabel|A run for me; Yay.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-3b1e92f933b25b2b239a.webm",
  "mabel|Runs like that keep me cheerful.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-b5583df1592996d53ce7.webm",
  "mabel|Lucky run for me.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-097ecd870293cc680e7a.webm",
  "mabel|Lovely run there.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-8a5a79e4374797a107ca.webm",
  "mabel|That run was nicely spotted.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-f3700759ff8c3d8bf379.webm",
  "mabel|Clever run, well done.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-dd4c498c40795706d7fd.webm",
  "mabel|You put that run together well.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-d00fb75f19e383981fe0.webm",
  "mabel|A good little run for you.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-94d73af3f4132f3f400d.webm",
  "mabel|Go.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-8eeb843110cfbd32f2ab.webm",
  "mabel|Last card.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-5e030d5ff475c56aefd2.webm",
  "mabel|Last card point sneaks in nicely.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-83b9949e9a38ed22559e.webm",
  "mabel|I'll take that last-card point, thank you.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-3b178f2713eb8bffd291.webm",
  "mabel|Last card is mine.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-070bbd4665348a85ff0a.webm",
  "mabel|That last card found a good home.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-f4230160ac18bb10f6cb.webm",
  "mabel|Last cards placed, time to count our hands.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-19aefcb0c8ffcc7e1858.webm",
  "mabel|Good finish, let's count our hands.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-62f7d3c5e9c6f60e9c6e.webm",
  "mabel|You can have the last one.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-d496eafa76c9c30cfe80.webm",
