  "mabel|Now that's a hand worth bragging about.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-ce6f6b149a36e53a0d82.webm",
  "mabel|Big hand for me; I'll try to act surprised.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-d82deb5738f6cacad2b9.webm",
  "mabel|Those points came in with a smile.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-236f10971a503bfb1a89.webm",
  "mabel|That hand treated me rather well.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-71616625629d55d25610.webm",
  "mabel|I cannot complain about that count.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-c1e3e50473f5c00f6d18.webm",
  "mabel|That's a strong hand.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-83f0cf20646ad21dac4d.webm",
  "mabel|Big points there; well earned.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-176918657223db8c9f82.webm",
  "mabel|You found a beauty of a hand.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-6242423869cca15653e6.webm",
  "mabel|That hand came together well.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-96b6f60c500bbc5519be.webm",
  "mabel|A very good count for you.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-b926c026dae261736ee4.webm",
  "mabel|Zero points. This hand is grounded.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-b8db34d36c989ba3713b.webm",
  "mabel|Well, that hand packed no lunch.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-45cbe7f37896f259fa70.webm",
