  "mabel|Not much hiding in that hand.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-26ef41dc1f9591c17d5c.webm",
  "mabel|Well, we can move along from that one.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-3005eacafb500dbacba2.webm",
  "mabel|Zero happens to all of us sometimes.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-56790ca4495bffcdbf44.webm",
  "mabel|Tough hand; next one will be kinder.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-269e107792aae02a13ab.webm",
  "mabel|No points there, but better cards are coming.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-6b2aa1a94a0badf85bda.webm",
  "mabel|That hand did not give you much.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-ef904fb36f7986369612.webm",
  "mabel|Looks like a nineteen to me.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-ab6b8cf4d13a1d78e101.webm",
  "mabel|That's a hearty crib, thank you very much.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-4f10ebb8e07c0dd6d707.webm",
  "mabel|Crib came through for me in style.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-12d3d55cecaee3f2b1e5.webm",
  "mabel|Big crib points always feel extra sweet.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-1755ba90c66018d2fc6f.webm",
  "mabel|That crib was worth waiting for.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-8fa3f45215b0d2b89d9e.webm",
