  "mabel|There, that feels a little closer.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-75274eb12729d63accbf.webm",
  "mabel|I am finding my way back.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-391e6b77a4bda3a08c61.webm",
  "mabel|Good game, everyone. That was fun.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-b4ea787fbc068b7ffb38.webm",
  "mabel|Made it to 121. Great table, friends.": "table-talk-voice/mabel-27dc0aca3a4472d87276.webm",
